openmediavault-filebrowser-quantum (8.1.4) stable; urgency=medium

  * Remove the leftover restricted volume check in the ctl:
    - 8.1.3 dropped the check from the RPC, but omv-filebrowserquantum-ctl
      kept its own copy, so applying the configuration still failed with
      "FATAL: storage source shared folder points to restricted volume"
      while the Salt state ran <ctl> up. The constant and both checks are
      gone, matching the rules of 8.1.3 (red line #9 only restricts the
      AI agent; the masking logic is untouched).

